[{"client_msg_id":"94132e3c-54db-4c1c-807c-8b26183130b6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1383415558343782414\u003e","ts":"1618667000.172700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya|@kaoriya\u003e: Willow配列ファン垂涎の新作キット\nWillow Pecoeのβ版を組み立てる配信やってます!\n\n\u003chttps://youtu.be/VlxoZLRWPAs\u003e\n\n#自作キーボード #WillowPecoe #βテスト","id":1,"author_name":"MURAOKA Taro","author_subname":"@kaoriya","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1383415558343782414","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1196794099/avatar_normal.JPEG","text":"Willow配列ファン垂涎の新作キット\nWillow Pecoeのβ版を組み立てる配信やってます!\n\n\u003chttps://youtu.be/VlxoZLRWPAs\u003e\n\n#自作キーボード #WillowPecoe #βテスト","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1618666946,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1383415558343782414","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1383415558343782414"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lsonY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4c736a5-5c7c-4966-9436-01bc960016bd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど。実家で飼ってた猫はどうだったかな。結局家の中では研がなくなったような","ts":"1618640954.172500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zdJX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9684ff3-667e-4ed9-ba23-9a94c861f8b0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うちの子は段ボールの爪とぎ以外では研がなくなりましたね。それがボロボロになって研ぎ心地が悪くなると畳とか柱とかでやってたわ。","ts":"1618640280.172300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U39s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80001429-1f32-487c-b4eb-2bbcd1dec1ed","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"うちはソファベッドとかファブリック生地のやつがぼろぼろですね…\n壁なんかは無傷","ts":"1618639300.171200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+87"}]},{"client_msg_id":"297e4bd0-bc19-48e2-aa67-e071dd1c7062","type":"message","user":"UK0JC4CM8","text":"研ぎ心地を極限まで高めた最大の家具・・・\nうちだと部屋においてあるストールがそれにあたりますね。\n\nもう四隅がボロボロｗ","ts":"1618637606.169900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=ais"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7626df8d-39d4-4a67-abf6-473afc7c45ab","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おとんの背中(人皮)","ts":"1618633521.169300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ytT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce2fdea3-f0d2-400e-9aa2-653df2bbc3cd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一番気持ちいところで研ぐので、もっと研ぎ心地の良いものを用意しとく、っていうのが家具を猫から守る最良の手段ですね。","ts":"1618633394.168900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5lM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7ac9158-f4c2-437b-a367-b32dd1d1beb2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":nail_care:","ts":"1618629362.168000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hLe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6f5bb9b-12a6-46e3-9485-a5b11a8eb0c1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"爪とぎはなぁ","ts":"1618628846.167700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xIWO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cda0341-3f2d-47db-aa9d-3f6ad8c590ca","type":"message","user":"UK0JC4CM8","text":"爪とぎになるのは一番危惧してるところがありますね・・・","ts":"1618628748.167500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xyb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8B3C7AC7-B55D-43F8-8374-338086010742","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"保護猫シェルターから今の猫を引き取ったときに、玄関廊下に柵の設置(上下の隙間は数センチしか許されなかった)が必須だったことを思い出しました","ts":"1618628533.166400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8NX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f8e5459-35cf-4d6f-bae8-70763d9efcd0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"猫「お、ちょうど良い爪とぎがあるな\n猫「お、登れるやん\n猫「お、上は通れるな","ts":"1618628221.163500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":4,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U81LLJ340","UK0JC4CM8","U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"yoshi","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"doushite","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O/GS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6b2152d-3ec8-4d3d-97aa-03c2afe38aee","type":"message","user":"UK0JC4CM8","text":"やっと猫が台所に入らないようにする扉ができた\n\n使った木材はホワイトパインで、塗料はワトコオイルのチェリー、折戸式です","ts":"1618623182.161200","files":[{"id":"F01U6H8SJGP","created":1618623059,"timestamp":1618623059,"name":"PXL_20210417_011852133.jpg","title":"PXL_20210417_011852133.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"UK0JC4CM8","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":332129,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01U6H8SJGP/pxl_20210417_011852133.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01U6H8SJGP/download/pxl_20210417_011852133.jpg","original_h":2688,"original_w":1512,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01U6H8SJGP-a6bcbb8ed1/pxl_20210417_011852133_64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01U6H8SJGP-a6bcbb8ed1/pxl_20210417_011852133_80.jpg","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01U6H8SJGP-a6bcbb8ed1/pxl_20210417_011852133_160.jpg","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01U6H8SJGP-a6bcbb8ed1/pxl_20210417_011852133_360.jpg","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":203,"thumb_360_h":360,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C